        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0018', 3, 'Evaluate 10-2i + -4+6i + 3-5i.', '9+9i', '9-i', '3-i', '17-13i', 'b', 1, 'Group all real parts and all imaginary coefficients separately.', 'Real part: 10+-4+3=9; imaginary part: -2+6+-5=-1. Hence the sum is 9-i.
