        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0019', 3, 'Evaluate 2-8i + -5-3i + 7+9i.', '4-2i', '14+4i', '4-20i', '-10-2i', 'a', 1, 'Group all real parts and all imaginary coefficients separately.', 'Real part: 2+-5+7=4; imaginary part: -8+-3+9=-2. Hence the sum is 4-2i.
Option A: correct result.; Option B: subtracted the second complex number instead of adding it.; Option C: used subtraction for the third imaginary part.; Option D: subtracted the third real part.'),
        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0020', 3, 'Evaluate -6+4i + 8-i + -2-7i.', '4-4i', '10i', '-16-2i', '-4i', 'd', 1, 'Group all real parts and all imaginary coefficients separately.', 'Real part: -6+8+-2=0; imaginary part: 4+-1+-7=-4. Hence the sum is -4i.
