        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0021', 3, 'If z=5+7i, find 3z.', '15+7i', '20+28i', '15+21i', '5+21i', 'c', 1, 'Multiply both the real and imaginary parts by the real scalar.', '3(5+7i) = 15 + 21i = 15+21i.
