        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0023', 3, 'If z=9-3i, find 4z.', '9-12i', '36-12i', '45-15i', '36-3i', 'b', 1, 'Multiply both the real and imaginary parts by the real scalar.', '4(9-3i) = 36 + -12i = 36-12i.
