        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0024', 3, 'If z=-7+5i, find 3z.', '-28+20i', '-21+15i', '-21+5i', '-7+15i', 'b', 1, 'Multiply both the real and imaginary parts by the real scalar.', '3(-7+5i) = -21 + 15i = -21+15i.
