        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0029', 3, 'If z=-3+10i, find 6z.', '-18+60i', '-3+60i', '-18+10i', '-21+70i', 'a', 1, 'Multiply both the real and imaginary parts by the real scalar.', '6(-3+10i) = -18 + 60i = -18+60i.
