        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0031', 3, 'Find 4+3i − (2+i).', '-2-2i', '6+2i', '2+2i', '2+4i', 'c', 1, 'Subtract real parts and subtract imaginary coefficients in the same order.', '4+3i−2+i=(4-2)+(3-1)i=2+2i.
