        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0033', 3, 'Find 8-4i − (-3+6i).', '5-10i', '11+2i', '-11+10i', '11-10i', 'd', 1, 'Subtract real parts and subtract imaginary coefficients in the same order.', '8-4i−-3+6i=(8--3)+(-4-6)i=11-10i.
