        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0035', 3, 'Find 10+2i − (-4-5i).', '14-3i', '-14-7i', '6+7i', '14+7i', 'd', 1, 'Subtract real parts and subtract imaginary coefficients in the same order.', '10+2i−-4-5i=(10--4)+(2--5)i=14+7i.
