        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0037', 3, 'Find -9+6i − (-2+3i).', '-7+9i', '-11+3i', '7-3i', '-7+3i', 'd', 1, 'Subtract real parts and subtract imaginary coefficients in the same order.', '-9+6i−-2+3i=(-9--2)+(6-3)i=-7+3i.
