        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0038', 3, 'Find 6+5i − (8-7i).', '14+12i', '2-12i', '-2-2i', '-2+12i', 'd', 1, 'Subtract real parts and subtract imaginary coefficients in the same order.', '6+5i−8-7i=(6-8)+(5--7)i=-2+12i.
