        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0040', 3, 'Find 12-3i − (5+11i).', '7-14i', '7+8i', '-7+14i', '17-14i', 'a', 1, 'Subtract real parts and subtract imaginary coefficients in the same order.', '12-3i−5+11i=(12-5)+(-3-11)i=7-14i.
