        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0041', 3, 'If z₁=7+i, z₂=4i, z₃=-3+2i, find 2z₁ − (5z₂ + 2z₃).', '20-22i', '8-14i', '20+18i', '13-23i', 'a', 2, 'Distribute the outside subtraction, then combine real and imaginary parts.', 'Real part = 2(7)−5(0)−2(-3)=20; imaginary part = 2(1)−5(4)−2(2)=-22. Hence 20-22i.
