        ('mth11a-03-mcq-0047', 3, 'If z₁=-3+8i, z₂=5-2i, z₃=-6+4i, find 5z₁ − (1z₂ + 2z₃).', '-8+34i', '-32+50i', '4+2i', '2+30i', 'a', 2, 'Distribute the outside subtraction, then combine real and imaginary parts.', 'Real part = 5(-3)−1(5)−2(-6)=-8; imaginary part = 5(8)−1(-2)−2(4)=34. Hence -8+34i.
