        ('mth11a-04-mcq-0051', 4, 'Find three numbers in G.P. whose sum is 21 and product is 216.', '3, 6, 12', '7, 7, 7', '3, 6, 24', '12, 6, 3', 'a', 3, 'Write the terms as a/r, a, ar; the product gives a³.', 'Let the terms be a/r,a,ar. Their product is a³=216, so a=6. The sum gives 1/r+r=5/2, whose roots are r and 1/r. Hence the numbers are 3, 6, 12.
