        ('mth11a-05-mcq-0250', 5, 'For the line 10x + 3y + 30 = 0, find its slope, x-intercept, and y-intercept.', 'slope -10/3, x-intercept 3, y-intercept -10', 'slope -10/3, x-intercept -3, y-intercept 10', 'slope -10/3, x-intercept -3, y-intercept -10', 'slope 10/3, x-intercept -3, y-intercept -10', 'c', 2, 'Compare with ax+by+c=0, then use −a/b, −c/a and −c/b.', 'Compare with ax+by+c=0. Then slope=−a/b=-10/3, x-intercept=−c/a=-3, and y-intercept=−c/b=-10. Thus slope -10/3, x-intercept -3, y-intercept -10.

