        ('mth11a-05-mcq-0251', 5, 'Find the acute angle between the lines x + y = 0 and x - y + 4 = 0.', '60°', '45°', '30°', 'arctan(oo)', 'd', 3, 'First convert both equations to slopes, then use the acute-angle formula.', 'The slopes are m₁=-1 and m₂=1. Hence tanθ=|(m₂−m₁)/(1+m₁m₂)|=oo, giving θ=arctan(oo).

