        ('mth11a-06-mcq-0017', 6, 'If one row is multiplied by k, the determinant is:', 'unchanged', 'multiplied by k', 'multiplied by k²', 'divided by k', 'b', 1, 'Recall the stated determinant property or formula.', 'Multiplying one row by k multiplies the determinant by k. Option A: using the wrong determinant rule or definition. Option C: using the wrong determinant rule or definition. Option D: using the wrong determinant rule or definition.'),
