        ('mth11a-06-mcq-0042', 6, 'For a triangular determinant, the value is:', 'sum of diagonal entries', 'product of diagonal entries', 'product of all entries', 'difference of diagonal entries', 'b', 1, 'Recall the stated determinant property or formula.', 'A triangular determinant equals the product of its diagonal entries. Option A: using the wrong determinant rule or definition. Option C: using the wrong determinant rule or definition. Option D: using the wrong determinant rule or definition.'),
