        ('mth11a-07-mcq-0014', 7, 'Evaluate lim(y→2) [(y² − 5)(y + 2)].', '36', '-2', '-12', '-4', 'd', 1, 'Evaluate each factor at the approach value and multiply the two limits.', 'Substitute y=2: [(2)²−5](2+2) = (-1)(4) = -4. Option A: changed −5 to +5. Option B: omitted the second occurrence of y. Option C: used y instead of y² in the first factor.'),
