        ('mth11a-07-mcq-0115', 7, 'Evaluate lim(z→0) [(√(5+z) − √(5−z))/z]', '2/√5', '1/5', '1/√5', '-1/√5', 'c', 2, 'Multiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the numerator, then simplify.', 'Multiplying by √(5+z)+√(5−z) makes the numerator 2z. After cancelling z and taking z→0, the result is 1/√5. Option A: failed to divide by the factor 2. Option B: forgot the square root. Option D: sign error in the conjugate difference.'),
        ('mth11a-07-mcq-0116', 7, 'Evaluate lim(z→0) [(√(6+z) − √(6−z))/z]', '-1/√6', '1/√6', '1/6', '2/√6', 'b', 2, 'Multiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the numerator, then simplify.', 'Multiplying by √(6+z)+√(6−z) makes the numerator 2z. After cancelling z and taking z→0, the result is 1/√6. Option A: sign error in the conjugate difference. Option C: forgot the square root. Option D: failed to divide by the factor 2.'),
