        ('mth11a-07-mcq-0151', 7, 'Evaluate lim(x→0) [(1+(1/2)x)^(2/x)]', 'e^(1/2)', '1', 'e^1', 'e^2', 'c', 3, 'Rewrite the expression in the form [(1+u)^(1/u)] raised to a constant power.', '(1+(1/2)x)^(2/x) = [(1+(1/2)x)^(1/((1/2)x))]^1. Hence the limit is e^1. Option A: used c/d as the final exponent. Option B: replaced e^c by c. Option D: used d instead of c as the final exponent.'),
