        ('mth11a-09-mcq-0101', 9, 'Differentiate y=(x²+2x−5)/(x²−3) with respect to x.', '\frac{2 x \left(x^{2} + 2 x - 5\right)}{\left(x^{2} - 3\right)^{2}}', '\frac{2 \left(2 x^{3} + 3 x^{2} - 8 x - 3\right)}{\left(x^{2} - 3\right)^{2}}', '\frac{2 \left(x + 1\right)}{x^{2} - 3}', '\frac{2 \left(- x^{2} + 2 x - 3\right)}{\left(x^{2} - 3\right)^{2}}', 'd', 2, 'Use y′=(D N′−N D′)/D², where N is the numerator and D the denominator.', 'Let N=x²+2x−5, D=x²−3. Then N′=2x+2, D′=2x. Substitution into (D N′−N D′)/D² and simplification gives \frac{2 \left(- x^{2} + 2 x - 3\right)}{\left(x^{2} - 3\right)^{2}}.
